# Release Readiness Checklist V3

## Purpose
Verify that all system components, documentation, security policies, and performance benchmarks meet production standards before deployment.

## Scope
- End-to-end release validation, security audits, and deployment sign-offs.

## SSOT
- `HEALTH IS ALL/00_PROJECT/RELEASE_READINESS_CHECKLIST_V2.mdux`

## Definitions
- **Production Readiness:** Absolute compliance with stability, privacy, and performance requirements.

## Runtime
- Pre-deployment staging environment and release management workflows.

## Rules
1. No release candidate may proceed if any critical security or data sync bug remains open.
2. All documentation must be synchronized with the latest engine version before tagging.

## State
- `ReleaseStatus`: DRAFT | REVIEWING | APPROVED | DEPLOYED

## Event
- `Event:ReleaseAuditPassed`: Authorizes deployment to production app stores.

## Example
- Validating privacy compliance and offline data encryption before final build compilation.

## Exception
- Minor UI warnings permit conditional deployment with a fast-track hotfix patch plan.

## Related Documents
- `HEALTH IS ALL/00_PROJECT/RELEASE_CHECKLIST_SPEC.mdux`
- `HEALTH IS ALL/01_ARCHITECTURE/SECURITY_POLICY.mdux`

